rce url="https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/feed_rss_created.xml">dotoryeee's blog</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/blog/2026/07/22/gpu-%EC%84%9C%EB%B2%84-%EA%B8%B0%EC%B4%88-%EC%A0%95%EB%A6%AC/</guid> <enclosure url="https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/assets/images/social/blog/2026/07/22/gpu-서버-기초-정리.png" type="image/png" length="14276" /> </item> <item> <title>GPU 분할 정리</title> <author>Jeongwon Lee</author> <category>AI</category> <description>GPU 한 장을 나눠 쓰는 Time-slicing·MPS·MIG·vGPU 4방식의 분할 단위와 메모리·장애 격리, 지원 하드웨어를 비교 정리</description> <link>https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/blog/2026/07/22/gpu-%EB%B6%84%ED%95%A0-%EC%A0%95%EB%A6%AC/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 22 Jul 2026 19:47:04 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/feed_rss_created.xml">dotoryeee's blog</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/blog/2026/07/22/gpu-%EB%B6%84%ED%95%A0-%EC%A0%95%EB%A6%AC/</guid> <enclosure url="https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/assets/images/social/blog/2026/07/22/gpu-분할-정리.png" type="image/png" length="13383" /> </item> <item> <title>NVLink와 노드 내 GPU 연결 정리</title> <author>Jeongwon Lee</author> <category>AI</category> <description>노드 내 GPU를 잇는 NVLink 세대별 대역폭과 NVSwitch·GPUDirect P2P·Fabric Manager 역할, PCIe와의 차이를 표로 비교 정리</description> <link>https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/blog/2026/07/22/nvlink%EC%99%80-%EB%85%B8%EB%93%9C-%EB%82%B4-gpu-%EC%97%B0%EA%B2%B0-%EC%A0%95%EB%A6%AC/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 22 Jul 2026 19:47:04 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/feed_rss_created.xml">dotoryeee's blog</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/blog/2026/07/22/nvlink%EC%99%80-%EB%85%B8%EB%93%9C-%EB%82%B4-gpu-%EC%97%B0%EA%B2%B0-%EC%A0%95%EB%A6%AC/</guid> <enclosure url="https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/assets/images/social/blog/2026/07/22/nvlink와-노드-내-gpu-연결-정리.png" type="image/png" length="16762" /> </item> <item> <title>InfiniBand vs RoCEv2 차이점 정리</title> <author>Jeongwon Lee</author> <category>AI</category> <description>노드 간 GPU 통신에 RDMA가 필요한 이유부터 InfiniBand 구성요소와 속도 등급, RoCEv2 무손실 이더넷 요구, GPUDirect RDMA와 rail-optimized 토폴로지까지 정리</description> <link>https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/blog/2026/07/22/infiniband-vs-rocev2-%EC%B0%A8%EC%9D%B4%EC%A0%90-%EC%A0%95%EB%A6%AC/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 22 Jul 2026 19:47:04 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/feed_rss_created.xml">dotoryeee's blog</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/blog/2026/07/22/infiniband-vs-rocev2-%EC%B0%A8%EC%9D%B4%EC%A0%90-%EC%A0%95%EB%A6%AC/</guid> <enclosure url="https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/assets/images/social/blog/2026/07/22/infiniband-vs-rocev2-차이점-정리.png" type="image/png" length="20442" /> </item> <item> <title>분산 학습 병렬화와 집합 통신 정리</title> <author>Jeongwon Lee</author> <category>AI</category> <description>집합 통신 연산과 Data·Tensor·Pipeline·Expert 병렬화, ZeRO·FSDP 샤딩, 병렬화별 NVLink·InfiniBand 링크 매핑을 표로 비교</description> <link>https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/blog/2026/07/22/%EB%B6%84%EC%82%B0-%ED%95%99%EC%8A%B5-%EB%B3%91%EB%A0%AC%ED%99%94%EC%99%80-%EC%A7%91%ED%95%A9-%ED%86%B5%EC%8B%A0-%EC%A0%95%EB%A6%AC/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 22 Jul 2026 19:47:04 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/feed_rss_created.xml">dotoryeee's blog</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/blog/2026/07/22/%EB%B6%84%EC%82%B0-%ED%95%99%EC%8A%B5-%EB%B3%91%EB%A0%AC%ED%99%94%EC%99%80-%EC%A7%91%ED%95%A9-%ED%86%B5%EC%8B%A0-%EC%A0%95%EB%A6%AC/</guid> <enclosure url="https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/assets/images/social/blog/2026/07/22/분산-학습-병렬화와-집합-통신-정리.png" type="image/png" length="13420" /> </item> <item> <title>쿠버네티스 GPU 스케줄링 정리</title> <author>Jeongwon Lee</author> <category>AI</category> <description>기본 스케줄러가 GPU를 모르는 문제부터 device plugin 등록, GPU Operator 구성요소, time-slicing과 MIG, DRA 성숙도, gang scheduling과 DCGM 지표까지 정리</description> <link>https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/blog/2026/07/22/%EC%BF%A0%EB%B2%84%EB%84%A4%